{"id":"n28949-1-7","stage":1,"title":"지하도 · 地下道","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28949-1-7-1","ko":"횡단보도가 없는데 어디로 길을 건너지?","zh":"这里没有人行横道，要往哪儿过马路呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"횡단보도가","meaning":"人行横道，斑马线","explanation":"횡단보도：人行横道，斑马线；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"횡단보도","audio":"/audio/1be9bc555fce2a5014b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73246","senseId":"1","lemma":"횡단보도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없는데","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길을","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건너지?","meaning":"过，跨过，渡过","explanation":"건너다：过，跨过，渡过；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"건너다","audio":"/audio/07eea3489942d9d94543.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53853","senseId":"1","lemma":"건너다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1be9bc555fce2a50","term":"횡단보도","zh":"人行横道，斑马线","audio":"/audio/1be9bc555fce2a5014b7.mp3","entryId":"73246","definition":"车道上标示出来的供行人横向穿过的路。","pronunciation":["횡단보도","휑단보도"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"d72c843